  <ItemGroup>
    <!--
      Core static library replaces the per-file ClCompile dance
      that used to pull production cpps directly. ProjectReference
      drags the linker into Core.lib, so the test EXE picks up
      GhosttyActions / CallbackDispatcher / SizeLimit / Fullscreen
      symbols without re-compiling them.
